/Title (AN3745, How to Calibrate 0g Offset for the MMA745xL Family - Application Notes)
/Author (Freescale Semiconductor, Inc)
/Subject (AN3745: In order to calibrate the MMA745xL 0g offset, the predetermined digital offset values should be subtracted from the reading of the actual digital sensing values.)
/Keywords (AN3745, Calibrate 0g Offset, MMA745xL, actual digital sensing values)
>>
